      "comment": "The guide correctly uses the Vermont wiki_place_page findings, including the 1771 Grant Survey Schedule (~1,800 grantees), the 1857 civil-registration date, and town-history reprints. However, it adds several unsupported claims about denominations, county formation, census history, and specific repositories. It also attributes information to Vermont-specific Wiki pages even though the wiki_read calls returned only generic content. These issues prevent a fully correct score."
